      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "© 2011 Wiley Periodicals, Inc.",
        "AbstractText": "Polyurethane chemicals are produced by the reaction of isocyanates and they may cause allergic contact dermatitis or precipitate asthma attacks. Contact dermatitis to polyurethane toilet seat has not been reported before. Herein we present a case of allergic contact dermatitis to polyurethane toilet seat."
